</ix:continuation></ix:continuation>
      <ix:continuation id="Text_285b295ebd24481786fd49919d27b6794" continuedAt="Text_285b295ebd24481786fd49919d27b6795"><ix:continuation id="Text_236d690998bc4d1db00fe7c23565535240" continuedAt="Text_236d690998bc4d1db00fe7c23565535241">
<div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;"> </span></div>
</ix:continuation></ix:continuation>
      <ix:continuation id="Text_285b295ebd24481786fd49919d27b6795" continuedAt="Text_285b295ebd24481786fd49919d27b6796"><ix:continuation id="Text_236d690998bc4d1db00fe7c23565535241" continuedAt="Text_236d690998bc4d1db00fe7c23565535242">
<div style="margin-left: 36pt; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;">Inventories are stated at the lower of cost or net realizable
        value.&#160; Cost, which includes amounts related to materials, labor and overhead, is determined on a first&#8209;in, first&#8209;out basis.&#160; Net realizable value is the estimated selling price in the ordinary course of business less reasonably predictable costs
        of completion, disposal, and transportation.</div>
</ix:continuation></ix:continuation>
      <ix:continuation id="Text_285b295ebd24481786fd49919d27b6796" continuedAt="Text_285b295ebd24481786fd49919d27b6797"><ix:continuation id="Text_236d690998bc4d1db00fe7c23565535242" continuedAt="Text_236d690998bc4d1db00fe7c23565535243">
<div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;"> <span style="font-weight: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-style: normal;"> </span> </span></div>
</ix:continuation></ix:continuation>
      <ix:continuation id="Text_285b295ebd24481786fd49919d27b6797" continuedAt="Text_285b295ebd24481786fd49919d27b6798"><ix:continuation id="Text_236d690998bc4d1db00fe7c23565535243" continuedAt="Text_236d690998bc4d1db00fe7c23565535244">
<div style="font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;">&#160;</div>
</ix:continuation></ix:continuation>
      <ix:continuation id="Text_285b295ebd24481786fd49919d27b6798" continuedAt="Text_285b295ebd24481786fd49919d27b6799"><ix:continuation id="Text_236d690998bc4d1db00fe7c23565535244" continuedAt="Text_236d690998bc4d1db00fe7c23565535245">
<div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;"> <span style="font-weight: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-style: normal;"> </span> </span></div>
</ix:continuation></ix:continuation>
      <ix:continuation id="Text_285b295ebd24481786fd49919d27b6799" continuedAt="Text_285b295ebd24481786fd49919d27b67910"><ix:continuation id="Text_236d690998bc4d1db00fe7c23565535245" continuedAt="Text_236d690998bc4d1db00fe7c23565535246">
<div style="margin-left: 36pt; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;">Management reviews inventories continually for aging or
        obsolescence and accounts for such items once identified. In 2022 and 2021, the Company disposed of inventory in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction name="femy:InventoryDisposals" id="Fact_a52965ffb44a4afb972df1a3c2edbf32" contextRef="c20220101to20221231" unitRef="U001" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2,847</ix:nonFraction> and
        $<ix:nonFraction name="femy:InventoryDisposals" id="Fact_33adc37beaba4c9598e49b3263b34901" contextRef="c20210101to20211231" unitRef="U001" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">586</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. As of December 31, 2022 and 2021, the FemVue reserve for slow moving, obsolete, or unusable inventories was $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InventoryValuationReserves" id="Fact_e62123bad2594c3290f2fb3f46f7dfa4" contextRef="c20221231" unitRef="U001" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2,103</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InventoryValuationReserves" id="Fact_4d4825b83be84da48628980175e6a820" contextRef="c20211231" unitRef="U001" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">850</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</div>
</ix:continuation></ix:continuation>
      <ix:continuation id="Text_285b295ebd24481786fd49919d27b67910" continuedAt="Text_285b295ebd24481786fd49919d27b67911"><ix:continuation id="Text_236d690998bc4d1db00fe7c23565535246" continuedAt="Text_236d690998bc4d1db00fe7c23565535247">
<div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;"> <span style="font-weight: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-style: normal;"> </span> </span></div>
</ix:continuation></ix:continuation>
      <ix:continuation id="Text_285b295ebd24481786fd49919d27b67911" continuedAt="Text_285b295ebd24481786fd49919d27b67912"><ix:continuation id="Text_236d690998bc4d1db00fe7c23565535247" continuedAt="Text_236d690998bc4d1db00fe7c23565535248">
<div style="font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;">&#160;</div>
