              <div style="font-style: italic; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;">License, Manufacturing, and Supply Agreement &#8211; Bayer Yakuhin</div>
