      <ix:continuation id="Text_5fcfb3ab0f4d477c9d2aef634571f8d92" continuedAt="Text_5fcfb3ab0f4d477c9d2aef634571f8d93">
<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="DSPFListTable" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">


  <tr>

    <td style="width: 18pt;"><br />
            </td>

    <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top; font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;">(a)</td>

    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top;">
              <div style="font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;">Paycheck Protection Program Loan</div>
            </td>

  </tr>


</table>
</ix:continuation>
      <ix:continuation id="Text_5fcfb3ab0f4d477c9d2aef634571f8d93" continuedAt="Text_5fcfb3ab0f4d477c9d2aef634571f8d94">
<div>&#160;</div>
</ix:continuation>
      <ix:continuation id="Text_5fcfb3ab0f4d477c9d2aef634571f8d94" continuedAt="Text_5fcfb3ab0f4d477c9d2aef634571f8d95">
<div style="margin-left: 36pt;">In <span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;">June 2021, the Company was notified by the
          Georgia Primary Bank (the Lender) that the unsecured loan in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ExtinguishmentOfDebtAmount" id="Fact_8e897130fd1c4f7b983c8609de30f0b9" contextRef="c20210601to20210630_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_GeorgiaPrimaryBankMember_UnusualRiskOrUncertaintyByNatureAxis_PaycheckProtectionProgramLoanMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">812,500</ix:nonFraction>, which was made pursuant to the PPP, and accrued
          interest of $<ix:nonFraction name="femy:ExtinguishmentOfAccruedInterest" id="Fact_6442e0334730406aa509f8731e153639" contextRef="c20210601to20210630_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_GeorgiaPrimaryBankMember_UnusualRiskOrUncertaintyByNatureAxis_PaycheckProtectionProgramLoanMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">9,015</ix:nonFraction> was fully forgiven; and, as a result, the entire amount was derecognized on the Company&#8217;s financial statements,
          which was included as other income for the twelve months ended December 31, 2021 on the accompanying statements of comprehensive loss. The Company is required to maintain all necessary records for at least <ix:nonNumeric name="femy:MinimumTermToMaintainForgivenessLoansRecords" id="Fact_bc34bfb7ae6847b4947b9065ae820c58" contextRef="c20220101to20221231_UnusualRiskOrUncertaintyByNatureAxis_PaycheckProtectionProgramLoanMember" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen">six years</ix:nonNumeric> following the date of forgiveness, and the SBA reserves the right to audit the Company&#8217;s fully forgiven PPP loan.</span></div>
</ix:continuation>
      <div style="margin-left: 36pt; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;">
        <ix:continuation id="Text_5fcfb3ab0f4d477c9d2aef634571f8d95" continuedAt="Text_5fcfb3ab0f4d477c9d2aef634571f8d96">
<div>&#160;</div>
</ix:continuation>
      </div>
<ix:continuation id="Text_5fcfb3ab0f4d477c9d2aef634571f8d96" continuedAt="Text_5fcfb3ab0f4d477c9d2aef634571f8d97">
<div><span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;"> </span>
       <span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;"> </span></div>
</ix:continuation>
      <ix:continuation id="Text_5fcfb3ab0f4d477c9d2aef634571f8d97" continuedAt="Text_5fcfb3ab0f4d477c9d2aef634571f8d98">
<div style="margin-left: 36pt; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;">As of December 31, 2022 and 2021, <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:NotesPayable" id="Fact_dbd3385ef6324eff9134ea854852dc7e" contextRef="c20211231_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_GeorgiaPrimaryBankMember_UnusualRiskOrUncertaintyByNatureAxis_PaycheckProtectionProgramLoanMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:NotesPayable" id="Fact_602dc797c4864bb99200bd69ee54ff93" contextRef="c20221231_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_GeorgiaPrimaryBankMember_UnusualRiskOrUncertaintyByNatureAxis_PaycheckProtectionProgramLoanMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> amounts were outstanding under the PPP loan. For the years ended December 31, 2022 and 2021, <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" id="Fact_e43c2cea27064bef82222a01efb8cc96" contextRef="c20210101to20211231_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_GeorgiaPrimaryBankMember_UnusualRiskOrUncertaintyByNatureAxis_PaycheckProtectionProgramLoanMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" id="Fact_740ba2a333e74f58b17bf5c1ca026485" contextRef="c20220101to20221231_LineOfCreditFacilityAxis_GeorgiaPrimaryBankMember_UnusualRiskOrUncertaintyByNatureAxis_PaycheckProtectionProgramLoanMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> interest expense on the PPP loan was recognized.</div>
</ix:continuation>
      <ix:continuation id="Text_5fcfb3ab0f4d477c9d2aef634571f8d98" continuedAt="Text_5fcfb3ab0f4d477c9d2aef634571f8d99">
<div style="font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;">&#160;</div>
</ix:continuation>
      <ix:continuation id="Text_5fcfb3ab0f4d477c9d2aef634571f8d99" continuedAt="Text_5fcfb3ab0f4d477c9d2aef634571f8d910">
<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="DSPFListTable" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">


  <tr>

    <td style="width: 18pt; font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;"><br />
              </span> </td>

