<div style="font-weight: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;">The following schedule indicates the expiration year, as of December 31, for the Company&#8217;s federal net
        operating loss carryforwards available to future years without taking into account any Section 382 limitations as of December 31, 2022:</div>
</ix:continuation></ix:continuation>
