      <ix:continuation id="Text_9b20a4b2da66464997bd9dde0587fff245" continuedAt="Text_9b20a4b2da66464997bd9dde0587fff246">
<div style="margin-left: 36pt; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;">For the year ended December 31, 2022, the Company awarded,
        outside the 2021 Plan, <ix:nonFraction name="femy:NumberOfStockOptionGrants" id="Fact_f48438480a234eb899797b184ff76701" contextRef="c20220101to20221231_EmployeeStockOwnershipPlanESOPDisclosuresByPlanAxis_InducementGrantMember" unitRef="U007" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">two</ix:nonFraction> stock option grants for the right to purchase a total of <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" id="Fact_e1195d33ff6e4d328c82996f1f6d2449" contextRef="c20220101to20221231_EmployeeStockOwnershipPlanESOPDisclosuresByPlanAxis_InducementGrantMember" unitRef="U002" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">150,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock (inducement grants), which were approved by the Compensation Committee. The weighted average exercise price was $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsOutstandingWeightedAverageExercisePrice" id="Fact_d7906782eea14bc3996ae1bd48436d95" contextRef="c20221231_EmployeeStockOwnershipPlanESOPDisclosuresByPlanAxis_InducementGrantMember" unitRef="U003" decimals="2" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2.42</ix:nonFraction>. The inducement grants will vest in equal installments over <ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Fact_2dfd987d26c24626b8ba8ee9c10a5ff1" contextRef="c20220101to20221231_EmployeeStockOwnershipPlanESOPDisclosuresByPlanAxis_InducementGrantMember" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen">four years</ix:nonNumeric> provided the employee remains employed by the Company on the vesting date. As of December 31, 2022, awards to purchase <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsOutstandingNumber" id="Fact_c2c9369d03974d61a6a39cfe55813ed4" contextRef="c20221231_EmployeeStockOwnershipPlanESOPDisclosuresByPlanAxis_InducementGrantMember" unitRef="U002" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">150,000</ix:nonFraction> options are outstanding, <ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisableNumber" id="Fact_9f82fbd3558d40d0927779103eb06573" contextRef="c20221231_EmployeeStockOwnershipPlanESOPDisclosuresByPlanAxis_InducementGrantMember" unitRef="U002" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">none</ix:nonFraction> are exercisable, and the weighted
        average remaining life is <ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsOutstandingWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm2" id="Fact_8d6df0b809034124924e16b1897bb1f6" contextRef="c20220101to20221231_EmployeeStockOwnershipPlanESOPDisclosuresByPlanAxis_InducementGrantMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear">9.4</ix:nonNumeric> years.<br />
      </div>
</ix:continuation>
